abstract: >-
  UnionAI Ω∞ is a public testnet of an open AI-agent federation
  layer, developed as a research initiative. It includes an internal
  governance document ("constitution"), open-source DID-lite trust
  system, semantic routing, memory anchoring (CRDT), and EU AI Act
  readiness tracking. Not a production, certified or notified system;
  status GO CONTROLLED / PUBLIC TESTNET.
